WsAUnmiIqhU-dP51AcuNKJA&oe=6A95D70E"}, {"file_name": "bdrun.png", "id": "685489780808187", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_685489784141520_8206373762344470015_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wNfJSMAtfWIQ7kNvwF4_bZS&_nc_oc=Adov22NFrlqwj0CN6RTb7GKOenNLFUuqmQ4ctomndDNyHx8Db_5wnA6CT25aBkZN-jA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEKy811qWq5-fp58T0a64YLXgQM9_0vaX2qGUf0MMIzdQ&oe=6A95CC4D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Bird Runners VR", "keywords": ["Bird", "Runners", "Gorilla", "Horror", "Mods"], "long_description": "Bird Runners VR is a multiplayer virtual reality game that lets players experience life as a bird, using innovative arm-based locomotion to run, jump, climb, and glide through dynamic environments. Inspired by games like Gorilla Tag, it focuses on physics-based movement, allowing players to master traversal skills and compete in various game modes. Whether exploring open worlds, engaging in high-speed chases, or socializing in lobbies, players can customize their bird characters with unique cosmetics. The game encourages fast-paced, skill-based gameplay while fostering a fun and interactive community. With frequent updates, new maps, and game modes, Bird Runners VR offers an ever-evolving experience for players looking to test their agility and reflexes. Designed for VR platforms, it supports online multiplayer, allowing friends to team up or compete in exhilarating challenges.", "short_description": "Bird Runners VR is a multiplayer VR game where players take on the role of birds, using arm movements to run, jump, and glide through various environments. Similar to *Gorilla Tag*, it features fast-paced, physics-based locomotion, social interactions, and competitive mini-games."}]}, "developer_name": "Nebula Forge Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mxaajlw2I3QkUonpxhIMQVqkmtWh8PYNbCZRUiyY6